 for viewing! This is my first time modelling anything, so I hope you like it! There are three different Graphics Packs to use, one for the Robe, one for the Rockstar Outfit, and another Rockstar Outfit version, but with Ralsei's normal hair, instead of the mohawk.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;GC Version: &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/641724"&gt;https://gamebanana.com/mods/641724&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Install Instructions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Vanilla: Put whatever folder you want (or &#13;
all of them, they're all counted as different graphics packs) in the &#13;
Graphics Packs folder in Cemu, then in Cemu, enable whichever version of&#13;
 the mod you want!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Randomizer: You can do the same as vanilla, &#13;
but you'll be missing out on the dialogue the randomizer edits and Chest&#13;
 Appearance Matches Contents will not work.&lt;br&gt;To make it work for Randomizer, you'll need to export the raw data of the changed content of the mod.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You'll need &lt;a href="https://github.com/KillzXGaming/Switch-Toolbox/releases/tag/Final" target="_blank"&gt;SwitchToolbox&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;You want to go to content/Common/Pack on whichever version of the mod you prefer.&lt;br&gt;The files you want to export the raw data are:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;permanent_3d.pack&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Link.szs/Link.bfres&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;permanent_2d_UsEnglish.pack (optional, just map textures)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;LinkPos_00.szs/timg/MapLinkS_00^l.bflim (Just export one of these two, they're both the same. Make sure to replace both though.)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;DungeonMapLink_00.szs/timg/MapLinkS_00^l.bflim&#13;
 (Just export one of these two, they're both the same. Make sure to &#13;
replace both though.)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;DungeonMap_00.szs/timg/MapLinkFace_00^l.bflim&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;DungeonMap_00.szs/timg/MapLinkFace_01^l.bflim&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Then, after generating the randomizer, replace the original files with the changed ones.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you want to use any parts of this mod in another mod, message @ismysticalhere on discord.</description>
