      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e280439fd34.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28043a23f5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28043aa5ba.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e280438cd28.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e280439045b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28043b3698.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e280439356a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28027950b5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28027b8c93.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e280437a79a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28027488b1.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28027a1344.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28027b2083.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28027d15fa.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28027b58c7.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28027b05eb.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28043a7e54.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28043add4c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e28043a3286.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e2802795157.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/68e280279d575.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b class="SelectedElement"&gt;Princess Link Playermodel for The Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker HD!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod was commissioned by Binglitpawn, and replaces the Default Link model with him wearing Princess Zelda's outfit. There's also an alternate version of him wearing her outfit from the Japanese New